674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KhUNp8z11zkQ7kNvwF6jsxc&_nc_oc=AdqGh-S-pAKt8vBj9QT0FMEGMdxfr09Fp1L7Qg4oYeUm3BNBD6bzFCtDV39KgcQSPjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0Mul-_Nbd81hlZ0B1TyEwIfBr8I6rt2gSz4eRSu-nDWg&oe=69D3C3D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=at_b-zVFtnwQ7kNvwGV7gDZ&_nc_oc=AdrGi6z2i_1U706dgp1HFj4tU0kzeoZVt_545HFylKkwqhqSxcj1Km2SHElUJL3ZtxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3I4yAK5oqghlhHTDWIVjt3Aksr_TfN6hFDNI5SegzSsg&oe=69D39456"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nfplwTljPCcQ7kNvwFLezBZ&_nc_oc=Adpb1oXuGmf9goynkxTL2CXK3nd6unS2uN1b7nrjkwSmDdNAJqfApg4tthb6f5Eucs4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0tQc18qsD2x6CBAIVqoflMFvxDAJptztC5Kad_z955qw&oe=69D3C8B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip